{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act16side_level_act16side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act16side",
  "stageId": "act16side_01",
  "title": "Darkness Beneath the Light",
  "storyCode": "GA-1",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1e39f4b144b02cbc8b207ab578b12335e89fb5ecf3e0cfab976e709afc96c9dc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So you're able to move around without your wheelchair now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#9$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, I've been rehabilitating pretty well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#9$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Last year, they had a wheelchair rapid-firing contest, which I won... and then the doctors banned me from competing again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We'd have to look for a Gun-Knight to beat your firing skills, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#10$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Aww, that's nice to hear."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#10$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'd be even happier if SOMEONE learned how to say a few nice words to the sick, like my darling Fiammetta here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mostima, are you just going to stand there pretending you're the curtains?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You know I'm not the type, Lemuen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#10$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What type? This is your first time back in two or three years. My memory's not that good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Fine. Lemuen fires better than anyone I know. Her skills are incredible."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#10$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mm-hm, that's more like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is El doing alright in Lungmen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I saw her recently. She's doing great."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You'd better worry about yourself before her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#10$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And I'll copy those words right back at you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#4$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How long are you going to stay this time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Dunno, really. But it'll be at least until the conference's over, Wednesday after next, I think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tuesday after."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, Tuesday. Otherwise, it's up to how that old weirdo feels. Who knows if he'll send me on some weird and wacky assignment again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Did you just call His Holiness...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "He's not gonna mind, Fiammetta."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#10$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you want to stay for a bit longer, I could help you there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That so."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#10$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Did you figure it out already?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Figure what out? What are you two talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Did you really not realize, Fiammetta?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who we've been handing our reports to for the last half year?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#4$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Was it that obvious?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wh-What...? Wait, Lemuen... you got a job at the Lateran Curia? While you're still in rehab...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#9$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't worry, it's just some secretary work."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How long will you stick with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#8$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm not sure yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Will you return to the Guard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#2$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Little chance of that now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your marksmanship, overlooked just like that... it's a mind-boggling waste."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#10$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You judge me so highly, Fiammetta, even though I messed it all up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That wasn't your fault."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And it wasn't yours either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#9$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't stretch yourself too thin."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The day will come when I settle the matter with him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#8$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, well. Mostima..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#10$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Can I rub your horns?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#5$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Spoilsport."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lemuen gazes out the window as Mostima stands beside it, idly playing with the flowers in her hands.\nIn a flash, Fiammetta returns to a time before.\nThe sun shines ever bright and beautiful during a Lateran springtime, and a hint of chill rides the air.\nThrough the window, she spots the roofs of church buildings large and small. Here and there, now and then, fowlbeasts streak across the sky.\nLemuen is peaceful in any ordinary time, occasionally uttering a remark or two. Around her, the atmosphere softens.\nThe standoffish Mostima relaxes without realizing, unable to sense the smile she lets slip.\n......\nJust as always.\nAs if none of it ever happened."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But it's only an illusion.\nAfter that night, not a night more could she soundly sleep."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "speakerToken": "avg_300_phenxi_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Lemuen..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Something's on my mind, Lemuen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "avg_213_mostma_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Does this hospital have all that many volunteers?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hm? I suppose."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Come in."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Conscientious Doctor",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_366_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Seniora Lemuen, I want you to look at this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Conscientious Doctor",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_366_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, you have visitors?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#9$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's alright, they're old war buddies of mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Conscientious Doctor",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_366_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "War buddies... you don't mean—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_353_1#9$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Conscientious Doctor",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_366_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In that case, maybe all three of you could take a look at these test results..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oren, do you know what you're doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe you'll be kind enough to tell me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's not going to think of your methods as just 'personal conduct.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She'll be thinking we're going out of our way to exhibit 'the Lateran stance.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Slip up for a moment and this becomes a diplomatic incident."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Isn't that exactly what you want?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Conflict leads to issues, issues require resolution, resolution needs a channel."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Laterano's providing a whole new way to resolve issues."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And we provide this method under two prerequisites—what we say has to carry enough weight, and what we say has to be 'appropriate'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Right, Laterano needs to have an 'appropriate stance.' If all we brought to the table was an ordinary roll of the dice, who'd need Laterano?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Wouldn't you say, Your Holiness?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Pope",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you agree with him, Vel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "He's pretending to be smart."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The reason Laterano stands upon this land, and the reason the Legati can cross all borders, is that Laterano possesses faith."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, it's because of Laterano itself that the Legati are given passage, Your Eminence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We all know clear as day that the true Lateran faith can't reach beyond the Sankta. I'm sorry, but it might let you down if you count on it to get things done."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oren, if you seek death, you can apply through the proper channels."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Pope",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Truthfully, I've never understood how you two manage to fight so much."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When I set out on my way back from Victoria to Laterano, Duke Gododdin asked me a question, and I believe it's not one I'm equipped to answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "He asked: 'Does anywhere in Laterano suffice to draw me there?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your Holiness, when we're sat at the playing table, will the cards in our hand be enough?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Apostolic Knight",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your Holiness, Mostima wishes to speak with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Apostolic Knight",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She states that what she must report cannot be heard by any other."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then we'll step outta your hair."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Pope",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You may go."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Pope",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Put her through."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
